<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cresud cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cresud cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analyst Martin Pradier cut his rating on Argentina's Cresud SA Monday to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The stock ... is now at a 35 percent premium and we thus believe the future upside potential on a one-year basis is more limited,&quot; he wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company closed Friday at 2.30 pesos in Buenos Aires.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
